<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Implement proper retry strategi=
es</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Monitor error rates and pattern=
s</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Provide meaningful error messag=
es</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Test error scenarios thoroughly=
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Use circuit breakers for extern=
al services</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Implement graceful degradation<=
/li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=E2=9D=8C Don'ts=
